### Create scan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "nginx:1.25",
  "options": {
    "ignoreUnfixed": true,
    "timeoutSec": 120
  }
}

### After you get scanId, fetch normalized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans/f86f60a0-a4be-4b7c-907e-d81f767781b7

### Fetch raw Trivy JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans/f86f60a0-a4be-4b7c-907e-d81f767781b7?raw=true

### Browse scan history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scans/history?page=0&size=50
